# ---------------- Knowledge base: fetched from upstream INSIDE the build ----
# These KB source dirs are cloned by fetch-kb (docker/kb-repos.txt) into the
# image layer; excluding them from the build context keeps the payload
# content off the host AV's radar AND prevents COPY from failing on
# AV-quarantined host files (EPERM).
